menu "ADS-B receiver"

config ADSB_BOARD_TBEAM_SUPREME_SX1262
    bool "T-Beam Supreme SX1262"
    default n
    help
        Select the T-Beam Supreme wiring and peripherals for the 915 MHz
        SX1262 hardware variant. This does not change the ADS-B receiver
        frequency or imply support for the separate 868 MHz variant.

endmenu
